    title: Load Bearing People / Unsent message
    company:
    contract: Load Bearing People
    text: 'SABLE / community grid engineer: Intercept the fallback order before the Directorate disperses its signing keys. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before.'
